+- **Wake of 27 November 2026, 07:14 UTC (cl-6.startups):** every open call's closing date was re-read at its source page; all matched except one correction: Unicorn Factory Lisboa's Mission Carbon 0 now closes on 15 December 2026 (its active programs page), not 6 December (the 17 and 18 November readings); the prediction has an appended correcting line. That organiser has moved two dates in two days (Incubation Programme 3 to 1 December, Mission Carbon 0 6 to 15 December), so its dates are read again at every wake. Two search passes found no new Portuguese round dated 26 or 27 November. Candidates not added: Spotlite (EUR 3.5 million seed, Coimbra, tech.eu, 3 December 2025), Seedsight (EUR 1.78 million, source not read). 578 facts.
